  m_Name: Carta_Telemedicina
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Telemedicina
  _titleEn: Telemedicine
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Consultas por v\xEDdeo e laudos a dist\xE2ncia levam especialistas a
    lugares onde eles n\xE3o existem."
  _summaryEn: Video consultations and remote diagnoses bring specialists to places
    that have none.
  _realWorld: "A Lei 14.510, de 2022, regulamentou a telessa\xFAde em todo o Brasil
    depois da expans\xE3o durante a pandemia."
  _realWorldEn: Law 14,510 of 2022 regulated telehealth across Brazil after its expansion
    during the pandemic.
  _tradeOffs: "Exige internet e familiaridade com a tecnologia, n\xE3o substitui
    o exame f\xEDsico e precisa proteger dados sens\xEDveis."
  _tradeOffsEn: It requires internet access and familiarity with technology, does
    not replace physical exams and must protect sensitive data.
  _sources:
  - Label: Lei 14.510/2022 (Planalto)
    Url: https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/_ato2019-2022/2022/lei/l14510.htm
